# SEO / Marketing

- Meta tags via `SeoHead.tsx` and `lib/seo.ts`; route map in `lib/seoRoutes.json`.
- Prerender: `frontend/scripts/prerender-seo.mjs` — keep titles/descriptions factual, no accuracy over-claims.
- Blog meta: `lib/blogMeta.ts` / `blogPosts.ts` — cite-only, India GCI positioning; not investment advice.
- Public assets: `sitemap.xml`, `robots.txt`, `site.webmanifest` stay in sync with routes.
- Competitor names only in internal docs — never in public SEO copy or OG tags.
- Align claims with `hand_labeled` cohort reality and `docs/customer/COMPLIANCE.md`.
